Section 6.01. The Borrower will not incur Indebtedness, except:
(a) Indebtedness under this Agreement;
(b) Indebtedness not to exceed $25,000,000;
(c) Indebtedness of Foreign Subsidiaries not to exceed $10,000,000;
provided that, in the case of clauses (a) through (c), no Event of Default shall have occurred and be continuing.
